🧭 MY CTI PATH

① FOUNDATION
   Learn the environment, people, tools, scope, and owners.

② PRIORITIES
   Define PIRs and identify critical technologies/assets.

③ PILOT
   Take one relevant threat signal from intake to action and closure.

④ ROUTINE
   Build reporting cadence, feedback loop, and useful metrics.

